<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila index ends up despite property stocks slump.</title>
<headline>Manila index ends up despite property stocks slump.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>------------------------- April 11 ----------------------------</p>
<p>* Banks, commercial-industrials lead gainers</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Manila stocks climbed to higher ground at the close on Friday on buying in banking issues and commercial-industrial firms, traders said.</p>
<p>The main index ended at the day's peak of 2,976.78 points, up 27.76 points following Thursday's 39.72 points gain.</p>
<p>Brokers said the two-day rise was &quot;technically induced.&quot;</p>
<p>The main index rose despite the property sub-index falling by 7.74 points to 1,417.93 points.</p>
